<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    
    <!-- Top Header Bar -->
    <header class="header-bar">
      <div class="pill-badge">
        <span>🚀 AI Synergy Hackathon 2026 • Round 1</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pill-badge coral">
        <span>Team Venator (ID: 60358412)</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Title -->
    <div>
      <h1>Time-Aware Digital Discoverability</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Tourism Beyond the Fort — Connecting Day Visitors with Authenticated Cultural Artisans Within Strict Time Windows</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid Layout -->
    <div class="bento-grid">
      
      <!-- Primary Search Card (Span 8) -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-col-8">
        <h2>Plan Cultural Detour</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px;">
          Origin: <strong><%= defaultOrigin.label %></strong> (Gwalior Micro-Corridor)
        </p>

        <form action="/search" method="POST" class="search-form">
          <div class="input-group">
            <label for="queryInput">What would you like to experience?</label>
            <input 
              type="text" 
              id="queryInput" 
              name="query" 
              class="query-input" 
              placeholder="e.g. Mujhe local khana khana hai (Hindi / Hinglish / English)"
              value="Mujhe local authentic khana aur Chanderi weavers dekhna hai"
              required
            >
          </div>

          <!-- Quick Category Chips -->
          <div class="chips-container">
            <span class="chip" data-query="Mujhe traditional Bedai aur Gajak khana hai">🍲 Authentic Culinary (Bedai & Gajak)</span>
            <span class="chip" data-query="Mujhe Chanderi weavers pit loom dekhna hai">🧵 Chanderi Silk Weavers</span>
            <span class="chip" data-query="Tansen classical Dhrupad music academy">🎵 Tansen Music Academy</span>
            <span class="chip" data-query="Sarafa lacquer and silver jewellery artisans">💍 Sarafa Lacquer Jewellery</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Time Budget Slider -->
          <div class="slider-container">
            <div class="slider-header">
              <label style="margin: 0;">Available Time Window (T_available)</label>
              <div id="sliderDisplay" class="slider-value">3.0 Hours (180 min)</div>
            </div>
            <input 
              type="range" 
              id="timeBudgetSlider" 
              name="time_budget_hours" 
              min="1.0" 
              max="8.0" 
              step="0.5" 
              value="3.0"
            >
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
              <span>1.0 Hour (Quick Detour)</span>
              <span>4.0 Hours (Half Day)</span>
              <span>8.0 Hours (Full Day)</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">
            <span>⚡ Verify Deterministic Feasibility</span>
          </button>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- Feasibility Architecture Card (Span 4) -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-col-4" style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #F8FAFC 100%);">
        <div class="pill-badge" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">
          <span>📐 Mathematical Model</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Strict Feasibility Inequality</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          A candidate place is recommended <em>if and only if</em> the total time envelope fits within your schedule:
        </p>

        <div style="background: #1E293B; color: #F8FAFC; padding: 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          T_outbound + T_return + T_visit + T_buffer &le; T_available
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--accent-coral-light); border: 1px solid #FECDD3; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #991B1B;">
          <strong>Mandatory 25% Safety Buffer:</strong><br>
          T_buffer = 0.25 &times; (T_roundtrip + T_visit)<br>
          Protects visitors from transit delays.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- System Decoupling Card (Span 12) -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-col-12">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <h2>Decoupled 3-Tier System Governance</h2>
          <div class="pill-badge green">
            <span>Curated Gwalior Pilot: <%= poiCount %> Active Cultural Sites</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;">
          <div style="padding: 16px; background: #F8FAFC; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;">
            <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-blue); margin-bottom: 6px;">Tier 1: Multilingual AI NLP</div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
              <strong>Google Gemini 1.5 Flash</strong> extracts semantic category, origin, and time intent from Hindi/Hinglish text. Gemini is strictly prohibited from inventing places or travel times.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="padding: 16px; background: #F8FAFC; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;">
            <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-coral); margin-bottom: 6px;">Tier 2: Node.js Math Engine</div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
              Evaluates deterministic travel-space arithmetic, applies the 25% safety buffer, and rigidly prunes candidate POIs that violate schedule boundaries.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="padding: 16px; background: #F8FAFC; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;">
            <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-green); margin-bottom: 6px;">Tier 3: Curated Heritage Data</div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
              MongoDB geospatial store containing authenticated master weavers, confectioners, and luthiers situated 3&ndash;8 km outside the tourist fort bubble.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
      <div>
        <strong>Team Venator</strong> (ID: 60358412) • ITM University Gwalior
      </div>
      <div>
        AI Synergy Hackathon 2026 • Theme 04: Tourism Beyond the Fort
      </div>
    </footer>

  </div>

  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
